WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.205 --> 00:00:08.174 line:92%
I've never had a relationship

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.142 size:81% position:41% line:92%
thats lasted very long

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:12.479 line:92%
Even now, that I've found

00:00:12.479 --> 00:00:13.146 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
my soulmate

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:16.116 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's taken work to

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:17.150 line:92%
keep that connection solid

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.688 line:92%
That's where Leslie and I are

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:22.689 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
right now

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:26.292 line:92%
Gotta a lot of work to do

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:29.496 line:92%
You know when you'll be back

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.331 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I don't know, later

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:32.465 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Gotta go

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:33.767 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Love You, Baby

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:54.521
&gt;&gt; WE HAD A LITTLE WEDDING THING
WITH EVERYONE WHICH WAS AMAZING.

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:59.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; IT'S OFFICIAL!
WE'RE MARRIED!

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:04.364
&gt;&gt; I REMEMBER WHEN MY PARENTS
CAME INTO MY ROOM WHEN I WAS 9.

00:01:04.364 --> 00:01:08.802
THEY TOLD ME THEY WERE GETTING A
DIVORCE.

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:13.073
AND I DON'T WANT THAT TO HAPPEN
TO ME AND LESLIE.

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:21.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
I DEFINITELY DON'T THAPT TO
HAPPEN TO OUR KIDS.

00:01:21.347 --> 00:01:28.088
LITTLE LAUREN.
&gt;&gt; I DON'T SEE WHAT THE BIG DEAL

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
IS.
I LOVE MY FAMILY, OKAY?

00:01:29.856 --> 00:01:33.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'M JUST BUSY.
THE SHOW, MOVIES, INTERVIEWS,

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.462 align:start size:94% position:6%
STAND UP.
IT'S A LOT.

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:42.068
AND KYLE, HE'S NOT BUSY.
HE'S BARELY ON THE SHOW AND WHAT

00:01:42.068 --> 00:01:46.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
HAS HE DONE IN THE LAST YEAR?
COME ON, MAN.

00:01:46.539 --> 00:01:50.477
&gt;&gt; LET ME KNOW IF YOU NEED ME.
&gt;&gt; SO MANY PEOPLE COME UP TO ME

00:01:50.477 --> 00:01:58.051
AND SAY WERE YOU NEIGHBORS TOO?
I'M LIKE YES.

00:01:58.051 --> 00:02:02.589 align:start size:94% position:6%
AWESOME.
&gt;&gt; CAN WE TALK?

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:05.859
&gt;&gt; I AM REHEARSING.
&gt;&gt; WHY DIDN'T YOU COME HOME LAST

00:02:05.859 --> 00:02:07.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
NIGHT?
&gt;&gt; I WAS AT THE OFFICE.

00:02:07.827 --> 00:02:10.997 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; WITH COLIN.
&gt;&gt; YES, BUT YOU KNOW IT'S NOT

00:02:10.997 --> 00:02:14.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
LIKE THAT.
&gt;&gt; WE NEED TO GET HELP.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:20.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I'LL, I'M NOT HAVING THIS
CONVERSATION WITH YOU.

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:26.012
&gt;&gt; TOMORROW IS HIS RECITAL AND
YOU PROMISED YOU WOULDN'T MISS

00:02:26.012 --> 00:02:27.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
IT.
&gt;&gt; I KNOW.

00:02:27.113 --> 00:02:31.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
I WILL BE THERE.
&gt;&gt; KYLE HAS BEEN TRYING TO SEE

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:33.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
SOMEONE TO TALK ABOUT OUR
PROBLEMS.

00:02:33.586 --> 00:02:36.689
I DON'T NEED SOMEONE TELLING ME
HOW TO LIVE MY LIFE.

00:02:36.689 --> 00:02:42.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I WILL START.
I LOVE HER.

00:02:42.362 --> 00:02:46.499
IT'S AN EMOTIONAL EXPERIENCE FOR
ME AND I CRY.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:54.140 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; AND I FEEL THAT MAKES HIM A
LITTLE BITCH.

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:56.910 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I JUST WANT TO MEMORIZE MY
LINES.

00:02:56.910 --> 00:03:00.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; I HAVE TO WORK LATE.
SEE YOU LATER.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:09.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; BYE, LESLIE.
WELL, TONIGHT IS THE BIG

00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:12.759
RECITAL.
I'M ACTUALLY PRETTY NERVOUS, BUT

00:03:12.759 --> 00:03:31.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
LITTLE LAUREN WILL BE GREAT.
I'M A PROUD DAD.

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:33.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
&gt;&gt; OH, MY GOD.
DID WE MISS IT?

00:03:33.613 --> 00:03:35.648
&gt;&gt; I'M SO SORRY.
WE WERE WORKING ON A SCRIPT AND

00:03:35.648 --> 00:03:50.063 align:start size:94% position:6%
GOT CARRIED AWAY.
IT'S MY FAULT.

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:54.701
&gt;&gt; I DON'T USUALLY SUPPORT CAST
MEMBERS SHOOTING EACH OTHER, BUT

00:03:54.701 --> 00:03:59.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
COLIN CAN BE ANNOYING.
&gt;&gt; WELL, IT'S BEEN A PRETTY

00:03:59.839 --> 00:04:03.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
CRAZY WEEK.
COLIN ENDED UP SURVIVING WHICH

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:07.780
IS AWESOME.
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW WHAT ELSE SURVIVED?

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:13.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
OUR LOVE.
&gt;&gt; WE ARE HAVING ANOTHER BABY!

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:15.421
WE WILL NAME HIM WEEKEND UPDATE.

